# merge 决策分支3：given 删除文件、current 未改该文件，删除并提交
> init
<<<
+ del.txt mbase.txt
> add del.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# current 侧改动无关文件，形成分叉
+ marker.txt mcur.txt
> add marker.txt
<<<
> commit "current side"
<<<

# given 侧删除 del.txt
> checkout other
<<<
> rm del.txt
<<<
> commit "given deletes del"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
<<<

# del.txt 已不存在；merge 已提交，工作区干净
* del.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master
other

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
